OL,3,ABobby Vylan faces no further action
OL,4,Aover IDF chant
OL,5,
OL,6,FPunk rapper Bobby Vylan will face no
OL,7,Ffurther action from the Met Police for
OL,8,Fchanting "death, death to the IDF
OL,9,F(Israel Defense Forces)" at an Al Quds
OL,10,FDay demonstration in central London.
OL,12,FThe force said it had investigated
OL,13,Fchants made by the performer on 15
OL,14,FMarch at a static rally held on the
OL,15,FAlbert Embankment.
OL,17,FA Met Police spokesperson said they
OL,18,Flooked into the language used, adding
OL,19,Fthey "recognised the concerns caused,
OL,20,Fparticularly among London's Jewish
OL,21,Fcommunities".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
